hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1841.1","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1841.2","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1842.1","Malik related to me that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha heard Anas ibn Malik say"
"1842.2","Malik related to me that Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha heard Anas ibn Malik say"
"1843.1","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that the Messenger of Allah"
"1843.2","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that the Messenger of Allah"
"1844.1","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Amr ibn Muadh al- Ashali al-Ansari that his grandmother said"
"1844.2","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam from Amr ibn Muadh al- Ashali al-Ansari that his grandmother said"
"1845.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that a beggar asked A'isha"
"1845.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that a beggar asked A'isha"
"1846.1","Malik informed me from Yazid ibn Khusayfah that 'Amr ibn 'Abd Allah ibn Ka'b al-Salmi informed him that Nafi' ibn Jubayr informed him from 'Uthman ibn Abi al-'As that he came to the Messenger of Allah ﷺ. 'Uthman said: I had a pain that was almost destroying me. The Messenger of Allah ﷺ said: Place your hand on it seven times and say: \"I seek refuge in the might of Allah and His power from the evil of what I find.\" He said: I said that, and Allah removed what was with me, and I have continued to command my family and others to do so."
"1846.2","Al-'Ala' ibn 'Abd al-Rahman heard him say: Charity did not decrease wealth, and Allah did not increase a servant with forgiveness except in honor, and a servant did not humble himself except that Allah raised him. Malik said: I do not know if this hadith is narrated from the Prophet ﷺ or not."
"1847.1","Malik related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi from Abu Said al-Khudri that some people of the Ansar asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1847.2","Malik related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Ata ibn Yazid al-Laythi from Abu Said al-Khudri that some people of the Ansar asked the Messenger of Allah"
"1848.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1848.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1849.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1849.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1850.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1850.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1851.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man of the Banu Asad said"
"1851.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that a man of the Banu Asad said"
"1852.1","Yahya related that Malik heard al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman say"
"1852.2","Yahya related that Malik heard al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman say"
"1853.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1853.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1854.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1854.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1855.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"
"1855.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that his father said"
